"By default, the :meth:`JSONLoader.load() "
"<psp.serializers.json.JSONLoader.load>` method only parses top-level "
"attributes like *tz* and *paths* and ignores the rest.  This is to give "
"users freedom to put in whatever they find useful (description, "
"checksums, etc.) without having to filter them out."
msgstr ""

